  "For rapid bulk download of files, the Ensembl FTP site is available as an end point in the Globus Online system. In order to access the data you need to sign up for an account with Globus, install the Globus Connect Personal software and setup a personal endpoint to download the data. The Ensembl data is hosted at the EMBL-EBI end point called \"EMBL-EBI Public Data\". Data from the Ensembl FTP site can then be found under the \"/ensemblorg/pub\". You can also click here to open the target directory.": "如需快速批量下载文件，可将 Ensembl FTP 站点作为 Globus Online 系统中的一个端点使用。要访问这些数据，您需要注册 Globus 账户、安装 Globus Connect Personal 软件，并设置一个个人端点来下载数据。Ensembl 数据托管在名为“EMBL-EBI Public Data”的 EMBL-EBI 端点下。随后可在“/ensemblorg/pub”下找到来自 Ensembl FTP 站点的数据。您也可以单击此处打开目标目录。",
  "Note: the API version needs to be the same as the databases you are accessing, so please use git to obtain a previous version if querying older databases.": "注意：API 版本需要与您正在访问的数据库相同，因此如果查询较旧的数据库，请使用 git 获取先前的版本。",
  "Entire databases can be downloaded from our FTP site in a variety of formats. Please be aware that some of these files can run to many gigabytes of data.": "整个数据库可以从我们的 FTP 站点以多种格式下载。请注意，其中一些文件可能达到数十 GB 的数据量。",
  "Each directory on https://ftp.ensembl.org contains a README file, explaining the directory structure.": "https://ftp.ensembl.org 上的每个目录都包含一个 README 文件，说明目录结构。",
  "The header line in an FASTA dump files containing DNA sequence consists of the following attributes : coord_system:version:name:start:end:strand This coordinate-system string is used in the Ensembl API to retrieve slices with the SliceAdaptor.": "包含 DNA 序列的 FASTA 转储文件的标题行由以下属性组成：coord_system:version:name:start:end:strand。该坐标系统字符串在 Ensembl API 中用于通过 SliceAdaptor 检索切片。",
  "All Ensembl MySQL databases are available in text format as are the SQL table definition files. These can be imported into any SQL database for a local installation of a mirror site. Generally, the FTP directory tree contains one directory per database. For more information about these databases and their Application Programming Interfaces (or APIs) see the API section.": "所有 Ensembl MySQL 数据库都以文本格式提供，SQL 表定义文件也是如此。这些文件可以导入任何 SQL 数据库，用于本地安装镜像站点。通常，FTP 目录树中每个数据库对应一个目录。有关这些数据库及其应用程序编程接口（API）的更多信息，请参阅 API 部分。",
  "Gene sets for each species. These files include annotations of both coding and non-coding genes. This file format is described here.": "每个物种的基因集。这些文件包含编码基因和非编码基因的注释。此处描述了该文件格式。",
  "GFF3 provides access to all annotated transcripts which make up an Ensembl gene set. This file format is described here.": "GFF3 提供对构成 Ensembl 基因集的所有已注释转录本的访问。此处描述了该文件格式。",
  "Alignments of resequencing data are available for several species as Ensembl Multi Format (EMF) flatfile dumps. The accompanying README file describes the file format.": "若干物种的重测序数据比对以 Ensembl Multi Format（EMF）平面文件转储的形式提供。随附的 README 文件描述了该文件格式。",
  "Also, the same format is used to dump whole-genome multiple alignments as well as gene-based multiple alignments and phylogentic trees used to infer Ensembl orthologues and paralogues. These files are available in the ensembl_compara database which will be found in the mysql directory.": "此外，同样的格式也用于转储全基因组多序列比对，以及用于推断 Ensembl 直系同源基因和旁系同源基因的基于基因的多序列比对和系统发育树。这些文件可在 ensembl_compara 数据库中获得，该数据库位于 mysql 目录中。",
  "MAF files are provided for all pairwise alignments containing human (GRCh38), and all multiple alignments. The MAF file format is described here.": "为包含人类（GRCh38）的所有两两比对以及所有多序列比对提供 MAF 文件。此处描述了 MAF 文件格式。",
  "GVF (Genome Variation Format) is a simple tab-delimited format derived from GFF3 for variation positions across the genome. There are GVF files for different types of variation data (e.g. somatic variants, structural variants etc). For more information see the \"README\" files in the GVF directory.": "GVF（Genome Variation Format）是一种源自 GFF3 的简单制表符分隔格式，用于表示基因组上的变异位置。针对不同类型的变异数据（例如体细胞变异、结构变异等）都有相应的 GVF 文件。更多信息请参阅 GVF 目录中的“README”文件。",
  "VCF (Variant Call Format) is a text file format containing meta-information lines, a header line, and then data lines each containing information about a position in the genome. This file format can also contain genotype information on samples for each position. More details about the format and its specifications are available here.": "VCF（Variant Call Format）是一种文本文件格式，包含元信息行、一个标题行，然后是数据行，每行包含基因组中某个位置的信息。该文件格式还可以包含每个位置上样本的基因型信息。有关该格式及其规范的更多详细信息可在此处获取。",
  "Compressed text files (called \"cache files\") used by the Variant Effect Predictor tool. More information about these files is available here.": "Variant Effect Predictor 工具使用的压缩文本文件（称为“cache files”）。有关这些文件的更多信息可在此处获取。",
  "Constrained elements calculated using GERP are available in BED format. For more information see the accompanying README file.": "使用 GERP 计算的保守元件以 BED 格式提供。更多信息请参阅随附的 README 文件。",
  "This site is a mirror based on code from Ensembl, a joint project between the Wellcome Trust Sanger Institute and the European Bioinformatics Institute. For more information about the Ensembl project, including contact details, please visit www.ensembl.org.": "本网站是一个镜像站点，基于 Ensembl 的代码构建。Ensembl 是 Wellcome Trust Sanger Institute 与 European Bioinformatics Institute 的合作项目。如需了解 Ensembl 项目的更多信息（包括联系方式），请访问 www.ensembl.org。"
 },
 "rules": [
  {
   "re": "^Release (\\d{4}-\\d{2})$",
   "to": "版本 $1"
  },
  {
   "re": "^Ensembl release (\\d+) - (\\w+) (\\d{4}) ©$",
   "to": "Ensembl 版本 $1 - $3 年 $2 ©"
  },
  {
   "re": "^Gene: (.+) — Ensembl$",
   "to": "基因：$1 — Ensembl"
  },
  {
   "re": "^Genome browser — Ensembl$",
   "to": "基因组浏览器 — Ensembl"
  }
 ]
}
